  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Cost:</strong> Open trailers are typically more cost-effective than enclosed carriers, making them a preferred choice for those on a budget.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Cost-effective:</strong> Open trailers may not be suitable for all vehicles, especially those that require complete protection from the elements. If your vehicle is not sensitive to weather conditions, open trailers could be a cost-effective solution.</span></li>
</ul>

<h3>When to Choose Enclosed Carriers:</h3>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Price:</strong> If the cost of your vehicle is high, or if your vehicle is sensitive to weather conditions, enclosed carriers are the way to go. These carriers provide the ultimate protection and ensure that your vehicle arrives at its destination in the same condition as it left.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Importance of Vehicle Condition:</strong> If the condition of your vehicle is of utmost importance, choosing an enclosed carrier will guarantee minimal to no damages during transportation. This is crucial for vehicles with high monetary or sentimental value.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Vehicles Sensitive to Weather:</strong> Sensitive vehicles, such as classic cars, luxury cars, or motorcycles, should consider enclosed carriers to protect them from weather elements like wind, rain, and dust.</span></li>
</ul>

<h3>When to Choose Open Trailers:</h3>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
