  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Non-sensitive Vehicles:</strong> For vehicles that are not particularly sensitive to weather conditions and have a moderate to low monetary or sentimental value, open trailers can be an appropriate option.</span></li>
